{"seq":3,"slug":"trust-evaluation-engine","title":"信任评估引擎设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/foundations/trust-evaluation-engine","wordCount":1255,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"信任评估引擎设计\">信任评估引擎设计</h1><p>策略引擎（Policy Engine, PE）是零信任架构的&quot;大脑&quot;——它接收来自身份提供商、设备态势系统、威胁情报、行为分析等多个信号源的实时数据，通过策略语言定义的规则集运算出访问决策。一个设计良好的信任评估引擎需要在毫秒级延迟内完成多维信号聚合，同时保证策略变更的可审计性与可回滚性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>策略引擎的表达能力取决于其底层策略语言。当前生产环境中主流的三种选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略语言</th>\n<th>开发方</th>\n<th>核心特点</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rego (OPA)</td>\n<td>CNCF</td>\n<td>声明式 Datalog 方言，通用策略引擎</td>\n<td>K8s Admission、API 授权、数据过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cedar</td>\n<td>AWS</td>\n<td>类型安全、快速求值、形式化验证支持</td>\n<td>AWS Verified Permissions、细粒度 ABAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUE/CEL</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>表达式语言，嵌入式轻量评估</td>\n<td>GCP IAM Conditions、Istio AuthZ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>OPA/Rego</strong> 是当前最广泛部署的通用策略引擎。其 Rego 语言基于 Datalog 的逻辑规则可以表达复杂的属性组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package authz&#10;&#10;default allow := false&#10;&#10;allow if {&#10;    input.identity.mfa_verified == true&#10;    input.device.compliance_score &gt;= 80&#10;    input.request.sensitivity &lt;= &quot;confidential&quot;&#10;    not threat_intel_hit&#10;}&#10;&#10;threat_intel_hit if {&#10;    input.context.source_ip in data.threat_feeds.malicious_ips&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package authz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default allow := false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.identity.mfa_verified == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.device.compliance_score >= 80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.sensitivity &#x3C;= \"confidential\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not threat_intel_hit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>threat_intel_hit if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.context.source_ip in data.threat_feeds.malicious_ips</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Cedar</strong> 由 AWS 于 2023 年开源，其设计目标是将策略评估延迟控制在亚毫秒级，并支持形式化验证（证明策略不存在逻辑冲突）。Cedar 使用实体-动作-资源的显式三元组模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cedar\" data-code=\"permit(&#10;  principal in Group::&quot;engineers&quot;,&#10;  action in [Action::&quot;read&quot;, Action::&quot;list&quot;],&#10;  resource in Folder::&quot;project-alpha&quot;&#10;) when {&#10;  context.device.encrypted == true &amp;&amp;&#10;  context.mfa_age_seconds &lt; 3600&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>permit(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  principal in Group::\"engineers\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  action in [Action::\"read\", Action::\"list\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource in Folder::\"project-alpha\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  context.device.encrypted == true &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  context.mfa_age_seconds &#x3C; 3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"信号聚合架构\">信号聚合架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 信号源&#10;        IDP[身份提供商]&#10;        CDM[设备态势 CDM]&#10;        UEBA[行为分析 UEBA]&#10;        TI[威胁情报 TI]&#10;        CTX[请求上下文]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 评估层&#10;        NORM[信号标准化]&#10;        SCORE[风险评分器]&#10;        PE[策略引擎 PE]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 决策输出&#10;        ALLOW[允许]&#10;        STEP[步进验证]&#10;        DENY[拒绝]&#10;        DEGRADE[降级访问]&#10;    end&#10;    IDP --&gt; NORM&#10;    CDM --&gt; NORM&#10;    UEBA --&gt; NORM&#10;    TI --&gt; NORM&#10;    CTX --&gt; NORM&#10;    NORM --&gt; SCORE&#10;    SCORE --&gt; PE&#10;    PE --&gt; ALLOW&#10;    PE --&gt; STEP&#10;    PE --&gt; DENY&#10;    PE --&gt; DEGRADE\">graph LR\n    subgraph 信号源\n        IDP[身份提供商]\n        CDM[设备态势 CDM]\n        UEBA[行为分析 UEBA]\n        TI[威胁情报 TI]\n        CTX[请求上下文]\n    end\n    subgraph 评估层\n        NORM[信号标准化]\n        SCORE[风险评分器]\n        PE[策略引擎 PE]\n    end\n    subgraph 决策输出\n        ALLOW[允许]\n        STEP[步进验证]\n        DENY[拒绝]\n        DEGRADE[降级访问]\n    end\n    IDP --&gt; NORM\n    CDM --&gt; NORM\n    UEBA --&gt; NORM\n    TI --&gt; NORM\n    CTX --&gt; NORM\n    NORM --&gt; SCORE\n    SCORE --&gt; PE\n    PE --&gt; ALLOW\n    PE --&gt; STEP\n    PE --&gt; DENY\n    PE --&gt; DEGRADE</pre><p>信号标准化层将异构数据源的格式统一为策略引擎可消费的结构。例如，不同的 EDR 厂商用不同的评分体系表达设备健康度——标准化层将其映射为 0-100 的统一合规分数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险评分模型\">风险评分模型</h2><p>信任评估的核心是将多维信号转化为单一的风险分数，再由策略规则将分数区间映射为决策。常见的评分模型：</p>\n<p><strong>加权线性模型</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = w_1 \\cdot S_{identity} + w_2 \\cdot S_{device} + w_3 \\cdot S_{behavior} + w_4 \\cdot S_{threat} + w_5 \\cdot S_{context}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: